<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2015/Studio.jpg" alt="Setting up in the new studio in Ballard" width="450" height="600" /></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I'm almost done moving in to the new studio in Ballard. This is a shot I took when I was halfway through. The studio has north light windows and I've put in some daylight LED bulbs above as work lights. I'm not sure their color rendering index is going to be great, but I think they will work when combined with the natural light.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I also paid a visit to the Dick Blick store which is just half a mile from our apartment. After stocking up on fresh mediums, varnish and a few stretcher bars&nbsp;<span style="line-height: 1.42857;">I'll be back to painting tomorrow!</span></p>